# Benchmark result artifacts are a record of what a particular run produced,
# so preserve them byte-for-byte. Python's csv.writer emits CRLF per RFC 4180;
# without this, Git normalises to LF and the committed file no longer matches
# the file the job wrote, which shows up as spurious diffs when a later run is
# compared against this one.
src/results/** -text
logs/** -text
